---
import Layout from "~/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <div class="nv-page-title">
    <h1 class="mt-6 text-5xl">Writer’s Block</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-6">
    <div class="wp-block-image is-style-default wp-duotone-unset-1">
      <figure class="aligncenter size-large is-resized">
        <img
          decoding="async"
          width="1024"
          height="1024"
          src="https://prisonercorrespondenceproject.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Writers-Block-IG-Square-1024x1024.png"
          alt=""
          class="wp-image-8039"
          style="width: 538px; height: auto"
          srcset="
                        https://prisonercorrespondenceproject.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Writers-Block-IG-Square-1024x1024.png 1024w,
                        https://prisonercorrespondenceproject.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Writers-Block-IG-Square-300x300.png    300w,
                        https://prisonercorrespondenceproject.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Writers-Block-IG-Square-150x150.png    150w,
                        https://prisonercorrespondenceproject.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Writers-Block-IG-Square-768x768.png    768w,
                        https://prisonercorrespondenceproject.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Writers-Block-IG-Square-100x100.png    100w,
                        https://prisonercorrespondenceproject.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Writers-Block-IG-Square.png           1500w
                      "
          sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px"
        />
      </figure>
    </div>

    <p></p>

    <p>
      <strong>WRITER’S BLOCK</strong> is our monthly penpal co-working session,
      where penpals get together to write/type their letters, meet other
      penpals, support each other, and add letter-writing to our calendars so it
      doesn’t fall to the wayside.
    </p>

    <p>
      We’ve often heard from outside penpals that they struggle to find time to
      sit down and write letters. These sessions were created specifically to
      address that need! A member of the PCP Collective is always there to
      facilitate, and will be happy to answer questions about penpal-ing.
    </p>

    <p>
      You have to register in advance for Writer’s Block using the link below.
      We will send you a reminder email before the session, and let you know
      when next sessions are planned.
    </p>

    <p>
      We meet on the fourth Wednesday of every month, from 5-6pm PT / 8-9pm ET
    </p>

    <h2 class="wp-block-heading">Join us for Writer’s Block 2026:</h2>

    <p>
      All Writer’s Block sessions use the same Zoom link! Register here:
      <a href="https://concordia-ca.zoom.us/meeting/register/I9foQBcmRIqO5jfIivs8oQ">
        https://concordia-ca.zoom.us/meeting/register/I9foQBcmRIqO5jfIivs8oQ
      </a>
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Upcoming dates:</strong>
    </p>

    <p>May 27, 2026 5-6pm PT / 8-9pm ET</p>

    <p>June 24, 2026 5-6pm PT / 8-9pm ET</p>

    <p>July 22, 2026 5-6pm PT / 8-9pm ET</p>

    <p>Aug 26, 2026 5-6pm PT / 8-9pm ET</p>

    <p>Sept 23, 2026 5-6pm PT / 8-9pm ET</p>

    <p>Oct 28, 2026 5-6pm PT / 8-9pm ET</p>

    <p>Nov 25, 2026 5-6pm PT / 8-9pm ET</p>

    <p></p>

    <p></p>

    <p></p>

    <p></p>
  </div>
</Layout>
